pi/procedures/search?q=...&lang=ar&limit=10\n - Uses tx_fts MATCH query for Arabic search (and fallback LIKE if FTS not available)\n - Returns: tx_no, title_ar/title, short_summary, tags\n\n3) Procedure detail\n- GET /api/procedures/{tx_no}?lang=ar\n - Returns full structured payload:\n - title\n - section/category (if present)\n - where_to_submit (office / ministry / association)\n - required_docs (normalized list)\n - time_limits (if any)\n - fees_or_amounts_lbp (if any)\n - contacts (phones, links)\n - steps (if stored)\n - related_procedures (from tx_links ordered by weight/similarity)\n - legal_basis (from tx_law_map joined with law_articles ordered by relevance desc)\n\n4) Law search (National Defense Law)\n- GET /api/law/search?q=...&limit=10\n - Uses law_fts MATCH\n - Returns: article_no + preview + (optional) title if exists\n\n5) Law article detail\n- GET /api/law/{article_no}\n - Returns: full article text + source metadata\n\n6) Chat endpoint (RAG-light, KB-first)\n- POST /api/chat\n Body: {message, lang_preference: \"ar\"|\"en\"|\"mixed\", context?: {tx_no?, article_no?}}\n Behavior:\n - Detect intent: procedure inquiry v", "metadata": "{\"source\": \"watany.txt\", \"keywords\": \"watany_guide_part21\"}"}
