e_number, received_at)\n- In webhook:\n - extract message_id from payload\n - if exists => return 200 without sending reply\n - else insert then process\n\n4) Normalize inbound message types\n- text, image, audio, document, location\n- ensure “one question at a time” response for media:\n - “وصلت … هل هو (1) هوية (2) دفتر عائلة (3) إفادة (4) غير ذلك؟”\n\n========================================================\nB) Elderly-first response behavior\n========================================================\n\n1) Message paging\n- In whatsapp_ui.py add:\n split_text(message, max_len=900) -> [chunks]\n- In whatsapp router send multiple messages sequentially if needed\n- Store state per user:\n wa_users.pending_paging = true\n wa_users.paging_cursor = index\n wa_users.paging_chunks_count = n\n- If user replies \"1\" and pending_paging true:\n - send next chunk\n - when finished, clear pending_paging\n\n2) Two-option clarification\n- When reranker returns ambiguous:\n - return ONLY 2 options with numbered choices (1/2)\n - do not show more than 2\n\n3) Caregiver summary\n- Add per user flag caregiver_mode (default false)\n- If enabled, append:\n \"ملخص للمتابعة: <one-line action + refs>\"\nKeep it", "metadata": "{\"source\": \"watany.txt\", \"keywords\": \"watany_guide_part71\"}"}
