dio\n - image\n - location\n- chat: guided menu response for short ambiguous queries\n- chat: returns ActionIntents when phone/link present in KB\n\n========================================================\nI) DOCS\n========================================================\nAdd docs/WHATSAPP_CHANNEL.md:\n- webhook setup\n- verification token\n- message types supported\n- limitations (no initiating calls)\nAdd docs/ACCESSIBILITY_UX.md:\n- principles\n- guided mode flows\n- caregiver mode\n\n========================================================\nJ) IMPLEMENTATION OUTPUT\n========================================================\nImplement all modules, endpoints, settings, and UI wiring described above.\nKeep changes compatible with existing codebase; modify existing files where they already exist.\n\nEND.\n\nCOPILOT SINGLE SCRIPT — “SUPERADMIN COPILOT BOT” (Runbook Coach + Admin Tasks Wizard) FOR WATANBOT\n\nRole: You are Copilot acting as a principal engineer.\nGoal:\nCreate an internal “SuperAdmin Chatbot” (an admin-only assistant inside the admin console and via admin API) that:\n1) Guides the operator (main engineer / admin) through testing, configuration, and maintenance tasks.\n2) Gener", "metadata": "{\"source\": \"watany.txt\", \"keywords\": \"watany_guide_part77\"}"}
