at does load reliably are the PDF forms and documents under the same Pensioners section, plus the MOF e-services pension inquiry page. \n\nSo we’ll extract what’s publicly accessible now (documents + e-services), and you’ll still get a clean, structured KB.\n\nWhat we can extract from that MOF “Pensioners” section\n1) Forms & documents (PDFs)\nFrom the Pensioners “Documents” directory, there are multiple official PDFs such as:\n\nBank account/IBAN update (“تعديل رقم حساب مصرفي”) \n\nReplacement pension book (“دفتر تقاعد - بدل عن ضائع”) \n\n“Basic reallocation documents” (مستندات إعادة التخصيص الأساسية) \n\nAdditional documents for specific beneficiary cases (daughter/son studying/mother, etc.) \n\nCircular/notice PDFs can also appear there (example doc ID “2768.pdf”). \n\nThese PDFs usually contain the “layout” you want (form structure) + the “required documents / instructions” text.\n\n2) Online e-service page\nThere’s an MOF e-service page for pension info (“معاش التقاعد”) that takes identifying fields (name, father’s name, family name, pension number). \n\nEven if we don’t scrape user data (we won’t), the page helps define what identifiers exist and what “l", "metadata": "{\"source\": \"watany.txt\", \"keywords\": \"watany_guide_part147\"}"}
