rticle number(s)\n\nShort excerpt/summary\n\nMust include a “View full article” action that opens the article panel.\n\n7) “Related procedures” block (correlations)\nShow “You may also need…” with 3–5 related transactions.\n\nThese come from the correlations graph we built (tx_links / similarity).\n\n8) “Sources & citations” behavior\nToggle: “Show sources”\n\nIf ON: show links like:\n\n“الدليل – المعاملة رقم X”\n\n“قانون الدفاع الوطني – المادة Y”\n\n(Optional) show PDF page references if available.\n\nE) Search & browse behavior (user experience)\n1) Two search modes inside the same window\nAsk Watany (chat): natural language Q/A\n\nSearch KB (direct): returns matching transactions/law articles like a search engine\n\n2) Search results cards (transactions)\nEach card shows:\n\nTransaction number + title\n\nSection name\n\nShort preview\n\nButtons:\n\nOpen details\n\nSave/Bookmark\n\nRelated procedures\n\n3) Browse by sections (accordion)\nSection list (القسم الأول…)\n\nExpand shows all “معاملة رقم …”\n\nClicking opens the transaction detail view (not just chat)\n\nF) Salary lookup UI (tables-based)\nWe discussed salary extraction by rank + degree from salary tables.\n\n1) Salary Lookup mini-form\nDropdown: Rank\n\nInput/Dropdown: Degree\n\nOptional: Year (e.g., 2017 if the", "metadata": "{\"source\": \"watany.txt\", \"keywords\": \"watany_guide_part303\"}"}
