c types\n\nShared services layer (روابط/دوام/هواتف) → referenced from multiple procedures\n\nThis is why the KB should include a correlations graph (similarity edges between procedures).\n\n2) Watany KB target design (recommended)\nA) SQLite (single-file KB) tables\nMinimum viable:\n\ntransactions (one row per procedure)\n\ntransactions_fts (FTS5 full-text search)\n\ncorrelations (tx_no_a, tx_no_b, similarity)\n\nOptional later:\n\nlaws_articles (national defense law / labor / civil service)\n\ntx_legal_basis (tx_no → articles)\n\nentities (offices, doc-types) normalized into join tables\n\nB) RAG JSONL (for embeddings + retrieval)\nOne chunk per transaction:\n\ntext: “القسم + رقم المعاملة + العنوان + النص”\n\nmetadata: tx_no, section, tags, urls, phones, etc.\n\n3) VS Code run guide (local workflow)\nCreate a folder (example):\n\nmkdir watany-kb\ncd watany-kb\nCreate and activate a venv:\n\npython -m venv .venv\n# Windows:\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate\n# macOS/Linux:\nsource .venv/bin/activate\nInstall requirements:\n\npip install pymupdf pillow pytesseract numpy pandas scikit-learn\nInstall dependencies required for OCR:\n\nTesseract with Arabic language pack (ara)\n\nLibreOffice (for DOCX → PDF conversion)\n\nPut your file in the fol", "metadata": "{\"source\": \"watany.txt\", \"keywords\": \"watany_guide_part400\"}"}
