ely “obsolete”.\n\nI’ve regenerated v4 الآن and verified the files exist in /mnt/data/.\n\n✅ Fresh working downloads (v4)\nAll-in-one ZIP: \n\nExcel (all tables):\nWatany_KB_Tables_v4.xlsx\n\nSQLite DB (with FTS5): \n\nRAG JSONL: \n\nWhat’s inside the folder\n/mnt/data/watany_kb_tables_v4/ contains:\n\nkb_transactions_v4.csv\n\nkb_requirements_v4.csv\n\nkb_steps_v4.csv\n\nkb_actions_v4.csv\n\nkb_authorities_v4.csv\n\nkb_document_types_v4.csv\n\nkb_eligibility_rules_v4.csv\n\nkb_links_contacts_v4.csv\n\nkb_relations_explicit_v4.csv\n\nkb_relations_inferred_v4.csv\n\nplus the Excel / SQLite / JSONL above.\n\nIf by “links are obsolete” you meant the URLs inside kb_links_contacts_v4.csv (not the downloads), tell me and I’ll produce v4.1 that either:\n\nremoves all external URLs, or\n\nkeeps only an allowlist (مثل: legiliban, army.gov.lb, finance.gov.lb, isf.gov.lb, …).\n\nYou said:\nwrite the vscode script fo v4\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nThought for 26s\nBelow is the single VS Code (Python) builder script for v4.\nPut it in your project folder as build_watany_kb_v4.py, put daleel.docx in the same folder, then run it from the VS Code terminal.\n\n1) build_watany_kb_v4.py\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"\nWatany KB Builder v4 (Retired Military Guide ->", "metadata": "{\"source\": \"watany.txt\", \"keywords\": \"watany_guide_part425\"}"}
{"chunk_id": "knowledge_knowledge_429_watany_guide_part426", "chunk_type": "knowledge", "doc_topic_no": "watany_guide_part426", "text": "KB tables + RAG + SQLite FTS)\n\nINPUT:\n - daleel.docx (same folder by default) OR pass --docx path\n\nOUTPUT (folder: ./watany_kb_tables_v4):\n - Watany_KB_Tables_v4.xlsx\n - watany_rag_chunks_v4.jsonl\n - Watany_KB_v4.sqlite (with FTS5 if available)\n - CSV tables:\n kb_transactions_v4.csv\n kb_authorities_v4.csv\n kb_document_types_v4.csv\n kb_requirements_v4.csv\n kb_steps_v4.csv\n kb_actions_v4.csv\n kb_forms_v4.csv\n kb_eligibility_rules_v4.csv\n kb_links_contacts_v4.csv\n kb_relations_explicit_v4.csv\n kb_relations_inferred_v4.csv\n kb_rag_chunks_v4.csv\n\nRUN:\n python build_watany_kb_v4.py\n python build_watany_kb_v4.py --docx \"C:\\\\path\\\\to\\\\daleel.docx\"\n\"\"\"\n\nimport argparse\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nimport re\nimport sqlite3\nimport zipfile\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\nfrom datetime import date\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# ----------------------------\n# Helpers\n# ----------------------------\nARABIC_DIGITS = str.maketrans(\"٠١٢٣٤٥٦٧٨٩\", \"0123456789\")\n\ndef stable_id(prefix: str, value: str, n=10) -> str:\n h = hashlib.md5((value or \"\").encode(\"utf-8\")).hexdigest()[:n]\n return f\"{prefix}_{h}\"\n\ndef norm_ws(s: str) -> str:\n s = (s or \"\").replace(\"\\xa0\", \" \").strip()\n s = re.sub(r\"[ \\t]+\", \" \", s)\n return s\n\ndef norm_digits(s: str) -> str:\n return norm_ws(s).translate(ARABIC_DIGITS)\n\ndef strip_punct(s: str) -> str:\n s = norm_ws(s)\n s = re.sub(r\"[()\\[\\]{}<>«»\\\"“”‘’]\", \" \", s)\n s = re.sub(r\"[:؛،,.\\-–_\\/\\\\|]+\", \" \", s)\n s = re.sub(r\"\\s+\", \" \", s).strip()\n return s\n\ndef norm_ar_match(s: str) -> str:\n s = norm_digits(s)\n s = s.replace(\"أ\", \"ا\").replace(\"إ\", \"ا\").replace(\"آ\", \"ا\")\n s = s.replace(\"ى\", \"ي\").replace(\"ؤ\", \"و\").replace(\"ئ\", \"ي\")\n s = s.replace(\"ة\", \"ه\")\n return strip_punct(s).lower()\n\ndef split_lines(text: str):\n out = []\n for ln in (text or \"\").split(\"\\n\"):\n ln = norm_ws(ln)\n if not ln:\n continue\n ln = re.sub(r\"^[\\-\\–\\•\\●\\*]+\\s*\", \"\", ln)\n out.append(ln)\n return out\n\n# ----------------------------\n# Patterns\n# ----------------------------\nsec_pat = re.compile(r\"^\\s*القسم\\s+(.+)$\")\ntx_pat = re.compile(r\"^\\s*(\\d{1,3})\\s*[_\\-–]\\s*(.+)$\")\n\ndate_pat = re.compile(r\"نسخة\\s+معدلة\\s+بتاريخ\\s*([0-9٠-٩]{4})[\\/\\-]([0-9٠-٩]{1,2})[\\/\\-]([0-9٠-٩]{1,2})\")\nurl_pat = re.compile(r\"(https?://[^\\s\\)]+)\")\nphone_pat= re.compile(r\"(?:(?:\\+?961)?\\s?(?:0?\\d{1,2})\\s?[/\\-]?\\s?\\d{3}\\s?[/\\-]?\\s?\\d{3,4})\")\nlbp_pat = re.compile(r\"(\\d[\\d\\.,]{2,})\\s*(?:ل\\.?ل|ليرة)\")\ntime_pat = re.compile(r\"(?:خلال|ضمن|مهلة)\\s+(\\d+)\\s*(يوم|أيام|شهر|أشهر|سنة|سنوات)\")\nFORM_PAT = re.compile(r\"(?:^|\\s)(?:ت|T)\\s*([0-9٠-٩]{1,2})\\b\")\n\nREQ_MARKERS = [\"المستندات المطلوبة\", \"الوثائق المطلوبة\", \"يرفق\", \"يُرفق\", \"تُرفق\"]\nSTEP_MARKERS = [\"الإجراءات\", \"الخطوات\", \"الآلية\", \"كيفية\", \"طريقة\"]\n\nAUTH_HINTS = [\n \"وزارة المالية\", \"دائرة التقاعد\", \"شؤون المناطق\", \"قسم الشؤون\", \"قيادة الجيش\",\n \"الطبابة العسكرية\", \"تعاونية موظفي الدولة\",", "metadata": "{\"source\": \"watany.txt\", \"keywords\": \"watany_guide_part426\"}"}
